BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:innovaud-ateliers-ia-pme-prilly-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261128T140412Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261210T160000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261210T190000
SUMMARY:Les ateliers IA — une soirée pratique pour les PME
LOCATION:Campus Unlimitrust\, Route des Flumeaux 42\, Prilly (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:Four parallel hands-on workshops for small and mid-sized compan
 ies — structuring team knowledge so AI tools give useful answers\, respo
 nsible generative AI\, being found in AI-generated answers\, and managing 
 AI risk — followed by feedback from the Cohorte IA programme and network
 ing drinks.\n\nOrganiser: Innovaud\n\nDetails and registration: https://sw
 issdataevents.ch/events/innovaud-ateliers-ia-pme-prilly-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/innovaud-ateliers-ia-pme-prilly-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
